---

---

<section class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
  <!-- Cabecera de características dividida en dos columnas -->
  <div id="about" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start border-b border-slate-900 pb-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight max-w-md">
      About me.<br />
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
      <p>
        I am a software engineer in training with a solid focus on <strong>Blockchain architectures</strong> and decentralized infrastructure deployment. My core experience revolves around designing and orchestrating robust ledger networks while keeping systems highly secure and scalable.
      </p>
      <p>
        I enjoy hands-on challenges: from constructing efficient Smart Contracts with <strong>Hyperledger Fabric</strong> and automating DevOps pipelines via <strong>Docker & Bash</strong>, to structuring intuitive interfaces. I aim to bridge rigorous backend engineering with clean, accessible product delivery.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Título secundario de la cuadrícula -->
  <div class="mt-24 text-left">
    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">
      Projects.<br />
      <span class="text-slate-500">What have I done?</span>
    </h3>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400 font-light">
      Here's a brief overview of some of the personal projects I've worked on,
      showcasing my skills and experience in software development.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Cuadrícula de Tarjetas -->
  <div id="projects" class="mt-12 space-y-6">
    <!-- Fila 1: Tres tarjetas pequeñas -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Tarjeta 1: Búsqueda -->
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-850 bg-slate-950/25 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden h-[400px] relative backdrop-blur-xs"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-40 mb-6">
          <img
            src="/assets/coin.png"
            alt="coin"
            class="h-full object-contain rotate-[-5deg]"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">FabricCoinDocs</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Documentation repository that explores the feasibility of
            implementing a fungible token, inspired by the Ethereum ERC20
            standard, on a permissioned blockchain network such as Hyperledger
            Fabric.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjeta 2: Seguridad -->
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-850 bg-slate-950/25 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden h-[400px] relative backdrop-blur-xs"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-54 mb-6">
          <img
            src="/assets/gestorFCT.png"
            alt="gestorFCT"
            class="h-28 object-contain"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">GestorFCT</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Internship management system designed to streamline the
            administrative processes of educational institutions. It provides a
            secure and efficient platform for managing student internships.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjeta 3: Comunicación -->
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-850 bg-slate-950/25 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden h-[400px] relative backdrop-blur-xs"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-36 mb-6">
          <img
            src="/assets/bookmarkSearch.png"
            alt="BookmarkSearch"
            class="h-40 object-contain"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">BookmarkSearch</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Chrome extension made for open bookmarks easily. Search for any
            bookmark you have by its title, the omnibox will suggest you to
            navigate to the url linked to the bookmark you're searching.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Fila 2: Dos tarjetas anchas -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Tarjeta 4: Tú marcas las reglas -->
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-850 bg-slate-950/25 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden h-[360px] relative backdrop-blur-xs"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-36 mb-6">
          <img
            src="/assets/virtualmouse.png"
            alt="virtualmouse"
            class="h-38 object-contain"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">VirtualMouse</h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Virtual PC mouse control system that allows users to control their
            computer's mouse cursor using their hand gestures. Developed with
            OpenCV and MediaPipe for real-time hand tracking and gesture
            recognition.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tarjeta 5: MyHome -->
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-850 bg-slate-950/25 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden h-[360px] relative backdrop-blur-xs"
      >
        <a
          href="#"
          class="text-xs md:text-sm bg-[#0f172a] w-45 text-center border border-slate-800 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-md shadow-black/40"
        >
          Actually Working on
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-36 mt-2 mb-6">
          <img
            src="/assets/fintech_quantum.png"
            alt="fintech"
            class="h-24 object-contain"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
            Quantum-Classical Hybrid DeFi & Portfolio Rebalancing Engine
          </h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            An automated solution that uses quantum computing algorithms to
            optimise the allocation of financial portfolios, combined with
            blockchain technology to ensure the secure and auditable recording
            of transactions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
